intro: Fire, water, wind, earth. They always come back.
win: Rank 7 after Rank 7. That's 2013 for you.
lose: You put the Rulers down. That never happens.
partner: Four elements and one partner. Whatever falls, I'll bring it back.
look: Fiery-haired adventurer in a four-colored elemental jacket (red, blue, green, brown) with dragon-tooth earrings.
ladder: 37   # campaign order (difficulty)
# Said during a duel: a big summon, hitting hard, taking a hit, falling to 1000 LP or less.
summon: The elements answer!
strike: Feel the heat of the Four Rulers!
hit: They always come back. So do I.
danger: Fire, water, wind, earth... don't fail me now.
